          "text": "Each side of a **30**-sided polygon has one of three lengths. The number of sides with length **8 centimeters (cm)** is 5 times the number of sides *n* with length **3 cm**. There are 6 sides with length **4 cm**. Which equation must be true for the value of *n* ?"
